An [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] '''training center''' was located on the [[planet]] [[Corellia]]. While on their way to the planet [[Ryloth]] aboard the [[cruiser]] [[Obedience|''Defiance'']], [[Galactic Emperor|Emperor]] [[Darth Sidious|Palpatine]] informed [[Commandant]] [[Pell Baylo]] that the [[Defiance Flight Training Institute|Baylo School]] run by Baylo would be folded under the existing training center on Corellia while Baylo took a chair at the [[Navigation institute]].<ref name="Orientation" />

